{"seq":39,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"冲突解决","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"冲突解决-从对抗走向建设性对话\">冲突解决：从对抗走向建设性对话</h1><p>每个工程团队都会经历冲突——技术方案之争、资源分配矛盾、跨团队协作摩擦。区别在于：有些团队在冲突中走向瓦解，有些团队却通过冲突获得更好的决策质量。Google 的 Project Aristotle 研究表明，心理安全感是高效团队的首要预测因子，而心理安全感的核心正是&quot;团队能否安全地处理分歧&quot;。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于<strong>冲突解决的系统方法论</strong>——从识别冲突类型、选择应对策略、执行关键对话，到建立预防机制的完整闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工\">与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>人际沟通</strong>（<code>06_interpersonal-communication</code>）覆盖日常说服、关系建立、跨职能沟通等广谱沟通能力——冲突解决是其中一个垂直切面，本 hub 在此维度做纵深展开。</li>\n<li><strong>谈判理论</strong>（<code>33_negotiation-theory</code>）聚焦利益分配博弈——谈判是冲突解决的子集手段之一，但冲突解决还涵盖情绪管理、组织文化、预防机制等谈判理论不覆盖的领域。</li>\n<li>本 hub 不重复兄弟 hub 已有的基础概念（如 BATNA、Cialdini 六原则），而是在冲突场景中引用它们并深化应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A（系统学习）</strong>：foundations → skills → contexts → prevention，适合想建立完整知识体系的读者。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B（即用即学）</strong>：先读 <code>2_skills</code> 中的关键对话技术与调解流程，遇到具体场景再回查 <code>1_foundations</code> 的理论框架和 <code>3_contexts</code> 的场景指南。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C（管理者视角）</strong>：从 <code>4_prevention</code> 的组织机制设计入手，理解如何从制度层面减少破坏性冲突，再补充 <code>1_foundations</code> 的诊断能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的沟通意识（能区分事实与观点、能做基本的倾听）</li>\n<li>对团队协作有实际体验（经历过技术评审、需求讨论等场景）</li>\n<li>无需谈判理论前置——本 hub 会在需要时引用并简要说明</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"冲突解决的理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conflict-types-and-sources","title":"冲突的类型与根源分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/foundations/conflict-types-and-sources"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thomas-kilmann-model","title":"Thomas-Kilmann 冲突应对模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/foundations/thomas-kilmann-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-escalation-dynamics","title":"冲突升级动力学与早期干预","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/foundations/conflict-escalation-dynamics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"skills","title":"冲突解决的核心技能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/skills","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crucial-conversations","title":"关键对话：高风险沟通的结构化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/skills/crucial-conversations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mediation-and-facilitation","title":"调解与引导技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/skills/mediation-and-facilitation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"emotional-management","title":"情绪管理与认知重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/skills/emotional-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"contexts","title":"冲突解决的场景应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/contexts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interpersonal-technical-conflicts","title":"个人间技术冲突的处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/contexts/interpersonal-technical-conflicts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-internal-conflicts","title":"团队内部冲突的诊断与化解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/contexts/team-internal-conflicts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-team-conflicts","title":"跨团队与组织边界冲突","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/contexts/cross-team-conflicts"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"prevention","title":"冲突预防与组织机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/prevention","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"psychological-safety","title":"心理安全感与反馈文化建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/prevention/psychological-safety"},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-norms-and-decision-frameworks","title":"团队规范与决策机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/prevention/team-norms-and-decision-frameworks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-conflict-recovery","title":"冲突后复盘与关系修复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/conflict-resolution/prevention/post-conflict-recovery"}]}]}